{"title":"Career Roadmap · Patent Attorney","role":"Patent Attorney","summary":"A Patent Attorney works at the intersection of law, science and technology. The professional helps inventors, research organizations, startups and companies protect technological inventions through patents and related intellectual-property strategies.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Science & Technology Law (B.Sc LLB)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Patent Attorney works at the intersection of law, science and technology. The professional helps inventors, research organizations, startups and companies protect technological inventions through patents and related intellectual-property strategies."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patentability analysis"},{"text":"Prior-art research"},{"text":"Patent drafting"},{"text":"Patent prosecution"},{"text":"Patent-office correspondence"},{"text":"Patent opposition"},{"text":"Patent infringement analysis"},{"text":"IP portfolio management"},{"text":"Technology licensing"},{"text":"IP due diligence"},{"text":"Patent litigation support"},{"text":"This career is particularly suitable for students who enjoy science/technology as well as legal reasoning."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important qualification distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A law degree alone should not be treated as automatically making someone eligible to practice as a registered patent agent/attorney in India. Patent practice involving representation before the Indian Patent Office is subject to the applicable statutory eligibility and registration requirements."},{"type":"p","text":"For an India-focused pathway, students should verify the current Patents Act, Rules and Patent Agent examination/registration requirements before selecting the final qualification route."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12 – Science","B.Sc LL.B / Relevant Science + Law Qualification","Science / Engineering Fundamentals","Intellectual Property Law","Patent Research & Drafting","Patent/IP Internship","Meet Applicable Patent-Agent Eligibility","Patent Agent Examination / Registration","Patent Professional / IP Associate","Senior Patent Associate","Patent Attorney / IP Counsel","Patent Portfolio / IP Strategy Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"A candidate can specialize in areas such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Telecommunications"},{"text":"Software/AI"},{"text":"Mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Materials science"},{"text":"Medical devices"}]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Science + Legal Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Science Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the B.Sc LL.B structure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biology"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Computer science"},{"text":"Scientific methodology"},{"text":"The exact subjects depend on the institution and specialization."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Foundation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Law of torts"},{"text":"Legal reasoning"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal language"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Intellectual Property Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Intellectual Property"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patents"},{"text":"Trademarks"},{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Designs"},{"text":"Trade secrets"},{"text":"Geographical indications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Invention"},{"text":"Novelty"},{"text":"Inventive step"},{"text":"Industrial applicability"},{"text":"Patent specification"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Disclosure"},{"text":"Prior art"},{"text":"Patent term"},{"text":"Ownership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Patent Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Drafting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the structure of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Title"},{"text":"Field of invention"},{"text":"Background"},{"text":"Summary"},{"text":"Detailed description"},{"text":"Examples/embodiments where appropriate"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Abstract"},{"text":"Drawings where required"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prior-art searching"},{"text":"Patent databases"},{"text":"Classification systems"},{"text":"Citation analysis"},{"text":"Patent-family analysis"},{"text":"Competitor patent analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Prosecution"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Invention","Invention Disclosure","Prior-Art Search","Patentability Assessment","Specification Drafting","Patent Application","Examination","Office Action / Objections","Response / Amendment","Grant / Further Proceedings"]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Advanced Patent & Technology Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent prosecution"},{"text":"Claim drafting"},{"text":"Patent infringement"},{"text":"Freedom-to-operate analysis"},{"text":"Patent opposition"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Technology transfer"},{"text":"IP due diligence"},{"text":"Patent portfolio management"},{"text":"IP litigation support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong project could involve a hypothetical technology such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-based medical device"},{"type":"p","text":"and cover:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Identify Novel Features","Prior-Art Search","Patentability Analysis","Claim Strategy","Patent Draft","Filing Strategy","Competitor Patent Mapping","Licensing / Commercialization"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Required Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Patent Law"},{"text":"Patent statutes and rules"}],[{"text":"Science"},{"text":"Relevant technical domain"}],[{"text":"Patentability"},{"text":"Novelty, inventive step, applicability"}],[{"text":"Patent Drafting"},{"text":"Specifications and claims"}],[{"text":"Prior-Art Search"},{"text":"Patent and literature searching"}],[{"text":"Prosecution"},{"text":"Office actions and responses"}],[{"text":"IP Strategy"},{"text":"Portfolio and commercialization"}],[{"text":"FTO"},{"text":"Freedom-to-operate analysis"}],[{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Technology/IP agreements"}],[{"text":"Litigation"},{"text":"Infringement and validity concepts"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Technical + legal research"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Patent databases"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Inventor interviews"}],[{"text":"Commercial"},{"text":"IP valuation/business awareness"}]]}]},{"heading":"Patent Professional Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Inventor / Research Team","Understand Technology","Identify Novel Technical Features","Prior-Art Search","Patentability Assessment","Claim Strategy","Patent Specification Drafting","Application Filing","Patent Examination","Office Objections","Legal / Technical Response","Grant / Further Proceedings","Portfolio Management"]}]},{"heading":"Patentability Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A patent professional must understand the difference between an interesting idea and a potentially patentable invention."},{"type":"h","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"h","text":"Novelty"},{"type":"p","text":"Is the claimed invention already disclosed in prior art?"},{"type":"h","text":"Inventive Step"},{"type":"p","text":"Does the invention involve an inventive contribution rather than being obvious to a skilled person?"},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Applicability"},{"type":"p","text":"Can the invention be made or used in an industrial context as required by applicable law?"},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Eligibility"},{"type":"p","text":"Is the subject matter eligible for patent protection under the applicable statute?"}]},{"heading":"Prior-Art Searching","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prior-art research is one of the most important skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Sources"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent databases"},{"text":"Scientific literature"},{"text":"Technical publications"},{"text":"Conference papers"},{"text":"Product documentation"},{"text":"Standards"},{"text":"Public disclosures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand Invention","Extract Technical Features","Identify Keywords","Find Classification Codes","Search Patent Databases","Review Similar Documents","Trace Patent Families","Compare Claims / Features","Prepare Prior-Art Report"]}]},{"heading":"Patent Databases & Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students should become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Patents"},{"text":"WIPO PATENTSCOPE"},{"text":"Espacenet"},{"text":"Indian Patent Office resources"},{"text":"Lens-type patent research platforms"},{"text":"Scientific literature databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Search Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword searching"},{"text":"Boolean operators"},{"text":"Classification searching"},{"text":"Inventor searching"},{"text":"Applicant searching"},{"text":"Citation searching"},{"text":"Patent-family analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Patent Drafting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Patent drafting requires both technical understanding and precise legal writing."},{"type":"h","text":"Claims"},{"type":"p","text":"Claims define the legal boundaries of the invention."},{"type":"p","text":"Students should learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Independent claims"},{"text":"Dependent claims"},{"text":"Claim elements"},{"text":"Claim scope"},{"text":"Claim dependencies"},{"text":"Functional vs structural language"},{"text":"Support in the specification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example Structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Independent Claim","Core Inventive Features","Dependent Claim","Additional Technical Feature","Further Dependent Claim","Optional Embodiment"]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual drafting should comply with the applicable patent law and procedural requirements."}]},{"heading":"Inventor Interview Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Patent professionals frequently need to convert technical explanations into legally useful information."},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What problem does the invention solve?"},{"text":"What existed before?"},{"text":"What is technically different?"},{"text":"Why does the difference matter?"},{"text":"How does the invention work?"},{"text":"What are alternative implementations?"},{"text":"What experiments or results support it?"},{"text":"What variations are possible?"},{"text":"Has the invention already been publicly disclosed?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Inventor Explanation","Technical Understanding","Identify Novel Features","Prior-Art Comparison","Legal Analysis","Patent Strategy"]}]},{"heading":"Freedom-to-Operate Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A patentability search and an FTO analysis are not the same thing."},{"type":"h","text":"Patentability"},{"type":"p","text":"Can this invention potentially receive patent protection?"},{"type":"h","text":"FTO"},{"type":"p","text":"Can a company commercialize a product without infringing relevant third-party rights?"},{"type":"h","text":"FTO Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product / Technology","Identify Relevant Features","Search Third-Party Patents","Identify Potentially Relevant Claims","Check Legal Status","Compare Product With Claims","Risk Assessment","Design-Around / Licensing Options"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, students should seek technical IP exposure, not only generic legal internships."},{"type":"h","text":"Target Organizations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IP law firms"},{"text":"Patent law firms"},{"text":"Patent-agent practices"},{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical companies"},{"text":"Biotechnology companies"},{"text":"Electronics companies"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Technology-transfer offices"},{"text":"Corporate IP departments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent Intern"},{"text":"IP Research Intern"},{"text":"Patent Research Intern"},{"text":"Technology Transfer Intern"},{"text":"IP Legal Intern"},{"text":"Patent Prosecution Intern"},{"text":"Patent Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["IP Research Internship","Patent Search","Patent Drafting Exposure","Patent Prosecution","Patent Agent / IP Associate","Patent Attorney / IP Counsel"]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Prior-Art Search"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a technology such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medical device"},{"text":"Solar technology"},{"text":"AI system"},{"text":"Battery technology"},{"text":"Biotechnology process"},{"text":"Perform a structured prior-art search and create a report."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Patent Claim Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a publicly available patent and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Independent claims"},{"text":"Dependent claims"},{"text":"Technical features"},{"text":"Specification support"},{"text":"Patent family"},{"text":"Legal status"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Patent Portfolio Mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a company/technology domain and map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major patents"},{"text":"Inventors"},{"text":"Applicants"},{"text":"Technology areas"},{"text":"Filing jurisdictions"},{"text":"Patent families"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Technology Transfer Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse how a university invention could move from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Invention","Patent","Technology Evaluation","Licensing","Industry Partnership","Commercialization"]}]},{"heading":"Technology Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The B.Sc LL.B background can be particularly useful when combined with a technical specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Biotechnology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Molecular biology"},{"text":"Biotech processes"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical technologies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chemistry / Pharmaceuticals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chemical processes"},{"text":"Formulations"},{"text":"Drug development"},{"text":"Materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Electronics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Circuits"},{"text":"Semiconductor technology"},{"text":"Telecommunications"},{"text":"Embedded systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software"},{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Cloud computing"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanical Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical systems"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Robotics"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"IP Law Firm"},{"text":"Patent drafting + prosecution"}],[{"text":"Patent Practice"},{"text":"Prior-art + claims"}],[{"text":"Pharmaceutical Company"},{"text":"Pharma + patent strategy"}],[{"text":"Biotech Company"},{"text":"Life sciences + IP"}],[{"text":"Technology Company"},{"text":"Software/AI patents + IP"}],[{"text":"Electronics Company"},{"text":"Hardware/telecom patents"}],[{"text":"Research Institution"},{"text":"Technology transfer"}],[{"text":"University"},{"text":"IP commercialization"}],[{"text":"Corporate IP Team"},{"text":"Portfolio + licensing"}],[{"text":"IP Consultancy"},{"text":"Patent analytics + strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Intellectual Property"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent law"},{"text":"Patent drafting"},{"text":"Patent prosecution"},{"text":"Patent searching"},{"text":"IP management"},{"text":"Technology licensing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on specialization:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Computer science"},{"text":"Mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Materials science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent analytics"},{"text":"Competitive intelligence"},{"text":"Technology landscaping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For the India-focused pathway, students should prioritize understanding the official patent-agent examination and registration requirements over collecting generic online certificates."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"LL.M."},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intellectual Property Law"},{"text":"Technology Law"},{"text":"Patent Law"},{"text":"Commercial Law"},{"text":"International IP Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Master's"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on background:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc"},{"text":"M.Tech"},{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Materials Science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Programs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IP Management"},{"text":"Technology Management"},{"text":"Innovation Management"},{"text":"Technology Transfer"},{"text":"A strong technical specialization can be highly valuable for patent work."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Patent Prosecution"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent drafting"},{"text":"Filing"},{"text":"Examination"},{"text":"Office actions"},{"text":"Amendments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Patent Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infringement"},{"text":"Validity"},{"text":"Patent disputes"},{"text":"Litigation support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Patent Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent landscapes"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Technology trends"},{"text":"Portfolio analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Technology Transfer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"University inventions"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Commercialization"},{"text":"Industry partnerships"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. IP Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Portfolio development"},{"text":"Patent valuation"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Competitive positioning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Patent Licensing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology agreements"},{"text":"Royalty structures"},{"text":"Commercial negotiations"},{"text":"IP transactions"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc LL.B","IP / Patent Internship","Patent Research / IP Associate","Patent Drafting & Prosecution","Patent Agent / Qualified Patent Professional","Senior Patent Associate","Patent Attorney / IP Counsel","IP Strategy / Portfolio Lead","Head – Intellectual Property"]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual use of the title Patent Attorney and authority to represent applicants before the patent office depend on the applicable professional/legal requirements."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI & Patent Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prior-art discovery"},{"text":"Patent classification"},{"text":"Similarity analysis"},{"text":"Patent landscaping"},{"text":"Claim comparison"},{"text":"Technology monitoring"},{"text":"Human review remains essential because patentability and infringement are legal questions requiring careful analysis."}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Software Patents"},{"type":"p","text":"Students interested in technology should understand the legal treatment of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software-related inventions"},{"text":"AI systems"},{"text":"Machine-learning applications"},{"text":"Computer-implemented inventions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Biotechnology"},{"type":"p","text":"Emerging areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gene technologies"},{"text":"Cell therapies"},{"text":"Synthetic biology"},{"text":"Bioinformatics"},{"text":"Precision medicine"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other Emerging Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quantum computing"},{"text":"Semiconductors"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Autonomous systems"},{"text":"Green technology"},{"text":"Advanced materials"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Medical devices"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Patent Attorney candidate should have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Foundation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent law"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Commercial law"},{"text":"International IP"},{"text":"Technology law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"At least one strong domain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Chemistry"},{"text":"Electronics"},{"text":"Computer science"},{"text":"Mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Materials science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prior-art searching"},{"text":"Patentability analysis"},{"text":"Claim analysis"},{"text":"Patent drafting"},{"text":"Patent prosecution awareness"},{"text":"FTO analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent internship"},{"text":"Prior-art project"},{"text":"Claim-analysis project"},{"text":"Patent-landscape project"},{"text":"Technology-transfer exposure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent databases"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Patent analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted patent research"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Sc LL.B"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Science / Technology Specialization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Intellectual Property Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patent Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Prior-Art Searching"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patentability Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patent Drafting"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Claim Drafting"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patent Prosecution"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"FTO Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patent Analytics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technology Transfer"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"IP Licensing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patent Litigation Awareness"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patent / IP Internship"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Applicable Patent-Agent Qualification"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc LL.B","Science/Technology Specialization","IP & Patent Law","Patent Research","Prior-Art & Claim Analysis","Patent Drafting","Patent Prosecution","Meet Applicable Patent-Agent Requirements","Patent Professional / Patent Attorney","Senior IP Counsel / Patent Strategy"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career mapping, the strongest profile is Law + Science/Technology + Patent Practice. The student should develop enough technical understanding to communicate with inventors and researchers while building advanced skills in prior-art searching, claim drafting, patent prosecution, FTO analysis and IP strategy."},{"type":"note","label":"Qualification note","text":"In India, the title and professional functions associated with a patent agent/attorney are subject to statutory requirements. An LLB or B.Sc LL.B by itself should not be represented as automatic eligibility for patent-agent registration or patent-office representation."}]}]}